    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS take great pleasure in presenting this superb two-bedroom own door ground floor apartment to the market in the ever-popular Parklands Court development in Ballycullen.\r\n\r\nThis exclusive and highly sought-after development is located at the foothill of the Dublin mountains and is bounded by attractive planting and manicured green space. It is conveniently located within a stone's throw of an array of amenities including local shops, shopping centres, primary and secondary schools; not to mention the M50 motorway less than 5 minutes by car.\r\n\r\nBright, airy & most spacious internal living accommodation of c. 70.7 sqm comprises of entrance porch, large open plan living/dining area with feature fireplace, fully fitted kitchen, two double bedrooms and main family bathroom. Just located outside the kitchen area is a beautifully kept green space perfect for relaxing & dining on them long sunny summer evenings. There is also designated parking and ample visitor parking spaces.\r\n\r\nNo. 1 is presented in great condition throughout having been lovingly maintained by its current owners and boasts extra high ceiling space, a superb addition to any apartment. The list of additional extras continues with double glazed windows, top quality blinds, gas fired central heating and ample storage to name but a few!\r\n\r\nWe expect plenty of interest from a wide range of buyers such as first-time buyers looking to get on the property ladder, anyone looking to downsizing or any keen investor looking to capitalise on the strong rents in the area.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly advised. Call Ray Cooke Auctioneers today for further information or to arrange viewing!!\r\n\r\nAdditional Features; \r\n- c. 70.7 sqm\r\n- BER C3\r\n- Management fee c. 1,300 per annum\r\n- 2 bed / 1 bath\r\n- Great condition throughout\r\n- Own door apartment\r\n- Located on the ground floor\r\n- Extra spacious living\r\n- Extra high ceiling space\r\n- Entrance porch\r\n- Open plan living/dining area\r\n- Feature fireplace\r\n- Fully fitted kitchen\r\n- Two large double bedrooms\r\n- Built in wardrobes\r\n- Main family bathroom\r\n- Communal rear garden space\r\n- Gas fired central heating\r\n- Double glazed windows\r\n- Top quality blinds\r\n- Top quality fixtures & fittings\r\n- Top quality flooring\r\n- Designated parking\r\n- Ample visitor parking\r\n- Highly sought-after development\r\n- Within two minutes' drive of M50 Motorway\r\n- A host of shops within walking distance\r\n- Highly regarded National & Secondary Schools within the area\r\n- Viewing highly advised!\r\n\r\nDirections\r\nIf travelling on Firhouse Road from Rathfarnham, turn left onto Ballycullen Road at Mortons Pub junction. Proceed ahead through the first set of traffic lights and at the next major junction turn right. At the roundabout take the first exit onto Parklands Road and then take the first right where number 1 Parklands Court will be situated in the first block on the right."
      },
